  "_comment": [
    "Vagaro category widgets. Each URL is a stateless, permanent link that renders",
    "that category's live services. Used for two things: the booking modal opens the",
    "right category instead of the whole menu, and the hourly sync reads prices from",
    "the scoped widget rather than matching against the full 57-service list.",
    "Regenerate in Vagaro -> Settings -> Booking Widget -> Choose Specific Widget Items.",
    "\"all\" is the unscoped widget: the fallback link and price source for any row whose category widget is missing."
